Tagger: KikeRev <enrique.revuelta@bain.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 1 12:10:22 2025 +0200

Release v1.1.0 - Success Index v2.1

Major Features:
- Success Index v2.1: Enhanced player recommendation system
- Multi-factor scoring: league, minutes, age, team strength, position
- Visual profile badges with interactive table
- Player profile page with radar charts
- Comprehensive testing suite (50 tests)
- Full documentation in README

This release significantly enhances the player recommendation system with a sophisticated scoring algorithm that considers multiple contextual factors beyond just playing similarity.

