    Feature/success index v2.1 (#11)
    
    * feat(reco): add /players/{id}/similar_team_fit endpoint and agent tool; compute team-position centroid fit and success_index
    
    * feat(agent): prefer similar_players_team_fit when team provided; include success_index in report context; add API and tool tests
    
    * test(api): remove legacy API tests; keep new success_index endpoint tests only
    
    * feat(agent): add similar_players_team_fit_table tool to return HTML table sorted by success_index
    
    * fix(agent): return_direct=True in team_fit_table tool so chat renders HTML table
    
    * feat(web): add player profile view and template; add route; link chat table names to profile
    
    * ux(profile): rename 'Key KPIs' to 'Statistics' in player profile
    
    * feat(profile): remove age from radar; add gameplay metrics per position and use dashboard_radar_single
    
    * feat(viz): restore original radar style; remove Age; add Progressive Carries; keep max ranges
    
    * revert(radar): restore original radar palette and labels; no Age; keep progressive passes received; adjust player_profile to use non-table stats metrics
    
    * fix(profile): use viz_tools.radar_chart (fixed max ranges) instead of dashboard_radar_single
    
    * fix(profile): eliminate radar-table metric overlap with position-specific KPIs
    
    * feat(table): add sorting and copy functionality to recommendations table
    
    * feat(profile): add team logo to player profile page
    
    * feat: implement success index v2.1 with enhanced recommendation system
    
    - Add SuccessIndexCalculator with multiple factors (league, minutes, age, team strength, position)
    - Implement 34 unit tests for all calculator functions
    - Integrate v2.1 into similar_team_fit endpoint with breakdown details
    - Update agent tools to use and display success_index_v2_1
    - Add visual profile badges in recommendation table (league tier, playing time, age)
    - Include profile legend with color-coded indicators
    - Translate all documentation and comments to English for consistency
    
    * feat: add integration tests and visual profile badges for success index v2.1
    
    - Add 16 comprehensive integration tests covering all v2.1 functionality
    - Test league weights, minutes weights, age weights, team strength, and position adjustments
    - Test sorting, filtering, edge cases, and real-world scenarios
    - Add visual profile badges to recommendation table (league tier, playing time, age)
    - Add profile legend with color-coded indicators (green/yellow/orange/red)
    - Sort endpoint results by success_index_v2_1 descending
    - Add test_client fixture to API tests conftest
    - All 16 integration tests passing
    
    * docs: add comprehensive documentation for success index v2.1
    
    - Replace basic success_index section with detailed v2.1 documentation
    - Add complete explanation of all weight factors (league, minutes, age, team, position)
    - Include tier system for 30 leagues across 5 tiers
    - Document API endpoint with full request/response examples
    - Add agent integration details and visual badge system
    - Include 3 practical examples with calculations
    - Add testing section with commands
    - Provide best practices and interpretation guidelines
    - Update features overview to highlight v2.1 capabilities
    - Total documentation: ~280 lines covering all aspects
    
    * chore: bump version to v1.1.0
    
    - Update version from 1.0.1 to 1.1.0 in pyproject.toml
    - Update README title to reflect v1.1
